 font-weight:900;
 line-height:1.2;
 color:#ffffff;
 ">
 Mentions légales
 </h1>

 <p style="
 max-width:700px;
 margin:20px auto 0 auto;
 color:#dbe4f0;
 font-size:14px;
 line-height:1.9;
 ">
